%description:
Tests the time that the send buffer limits the sender (STATUS sndbufLimited,
Linux TCP_CHRONO_SNDBUF_LIMITED). The client sends 1000 bytes at 1 s, and its
application tells TCP at 1.1 s that its writer is blocked on the send buffer
(TcpSocket::setWriterBlocked()). The time runs while no unsent data waits and
data is in flight: from 1.1 s to the ACK of all data at 1.204 s. STATUS shows
0.05 s at 1.15 s and 0.104 s at 2 s.

%inifile: omnetpp.ini
[General]
record-vector-results = false
ned-path = .;../../../../src;../../lib

cmdenv-event-banners=false
cmdenv-express-mode=false

*.testing=true
cmdenv-log-prefix="[%c]: "

*.cli_app.sendScript="1.0 1000"
*.cli_app.writerBlockedScript="1.1 1; 1.5 0"
*.cli_app.statusRequestScript="1.15,2"

include ../../lib/defaults.ini

%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%file: postrun.pl
open FILE, '<test.out';
while($sor = <FILE>)
{
    if ($sor =~ /^\[testing\]: (.*)$/)
    {
        print "$1\n";
    }
}
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%postrun-command:  perl ./postrun.pl
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%contains: postrun-command(1).out
[0.001 A001] A.1000 > B.2000: S 0:0(0) win 16384   Option(s): MaxSegSize
srv_tcp: LISTEN --> SYN_RCVD  (on RCV_SYN)
[0.003 B001] A.1000 < B.2000: A S 500:500(0) ack 1 win 16384   Option(s): MaxSegSize
cli_tcp: SYN_SENT --> ESTABLISHED  (on RCV_SYN_ACK)
[0.005 A002] A.1000 > B.2000: A ack 501 win 16384 
srv_tcp: SYN_RCVD --> ESTABLISHED  (on RCV_ACK)
[1.001 A003] A.1000 > B.2000: A 1:1001(1000) ack 501 win 16384 
[1.203 B002] A.1000 < B.2000: A ack 1001 win 16384 
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%contains: stdout
STATUS: skRcvbuf=0 sndbufLimited=0.05
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%contains: stdout
STATUS: skRcvbuf=0 sndbufLimited=0.104
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%postrun-command: grep "undisposed object:" test.out > test_undisposed.out || true
%not-contains: test_undisposed.out
undisposed object: (
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
